            <section>
                <h2>The Big Question</h2>
                <div class="r-stack">
                    <div class="fragment fade-in-then-out">
                        <div class="question-box">
                            <p style="font-size:1.25em;">🧑‍💻 You write: <code>print(\"Hello\")</code></p>
                            <p style="font-size:1.25em;">But the CPU only executes <strong>machine code</strong> (binary).</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fragment fade-in-then-out">
                        <div class="box" style="background:#ffebee; padding: 30px;">
                            <p style="font-size:1.2em;">❌ Common misconception...</p>
